<h1>Flagged</h1>
<p class="hint">Things somebody asked a person to look at. <strong>Nothing here has happened
  automatically</strong> &mdash; nothing was hidden, scored down or removed, and whoever wrote it has
  not been told. That is the deal: the software gathers the signal and a person keeps the judgement,
  which is the only division of labour that works for the thing this exists for.</p>
<p class="hint">Reading it and deciding it is fine is a real outcome, and <em>looked at it</em> keeps
  the record: the next flag on the same thing arrives with its history behind it.</p>
